{"v":4,"catch":"NAMCO經典角色全陣容！","desc":"《TINKLE PIT》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1993年發行的動作遊戲。\n你的目標：從邪惡的咒語中拯救叮噹之地並恢復世界和平！\n具有取材自 NAMCO 經典的角色和高分競賽的深度遊戲玩法！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-07-11","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae7ff213e6c3264fdc85f7a402865da04e0d5b262de0e32e25147f994ba00450.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8f6ac972b27bc89d234006af4d56021b9820dbf56e6850b6bf226754e5779662.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ffc6d6b4b0fa4dc24424762963385d82b0bf4463ad9574d70e39c7c1459a726e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/237565e635346de526f2b008c30eb575c41940ab496e767ccad3ee11901c0a10.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e599a9c948a6aa5174149bc5064b1742ecda0dd8a7bea306613c97ca375f74c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/356da195ce8eacff2cf10ba1a67d68b36e023fb43f1a31544e507af602324945.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b0601ecba000","dlc":[]}